---
description: Core Fusionify Coffee repository rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` before material changes.

Non-negotiable:
- No AI slop.
- No vibe coding.
- No AI-style overengineering.
- No gradients.
- No fake functionality or fake production data.
- No secrets, API keys, keystores, or signing credentials in Git.
- Do not expose payment-provider private credentials to Flutter.
- Do not rewrite working architecture without documented justification.
- Do not claim a test passed if it was not run.

Prefer the smallest correct change. Inspect existing code before creating new abstractions.
